{"detail": {"templateUuid": "66bd4d27b7ee4064977569587ea04a73", "projectUuid": "bca950a07b434fbab90f695a7d42bc9c", "name": "小米 SU7 Ultra 品牌概念片《同频》—— 将极致性能，归于初心的第一声律动", "description": "如何定义一台巅峰性能车的精神内核？\n在小米 SU7 Ultra 的品牌构建中，1.97s 的零百加速不仅是物理极限的突破，更是情感抵达的工具。本片避开了传统汽车广告对参数的枯燥堆砌，转而探讨驾驶者与“最初自我”的深层联系。\n我选择了 90 后共同的记忆符号——四驱车，作为情感母体。通过“四驱车”与“SU7 Ultra”的符号对位，建立起一场跨越 20 年的时空对话。", "coverUrl": "/assets/5048cbb8aa1d69b8.webp", "finalOutput": "https://libtv-res.liblib.art/upload-images/4c68f71a8ace435b99086ffa87cdca43/2b6aec8681b31af9b883307ac68caf007bdd9c39.mp4", "snapshotId": 7925, "auditStatus": 1, "ownerId": 5083534, "ownerUuid": "4c68f71a8ace435b99086ffa87cdca43", "avatar": "/assets/1c84c4f8c8b55857.webp", "nickname": "BoliSuna", "isLike": false, "likeCount": 533, "tags": [{"id": 1101, "code": "product_show", "tagLabel": "产品展示", "parentTag": 1100, "categoryId": 0, "path": "1100/1101/", "tagStatus": 1, "tagOrder": 1, "tagIcon": "", "children": null, "tagType": 1}, {"id": 1000, "code": "selected", "tagLabel": "精选画布", "parentTag": 0, "categoryId": 0, "path": "1000/", "tagStatus": 1, "tagOrder": 1, "tagIcon": "", "children": null, "tagType": 1}], "userTags": [{"tagId": 5001, "name": "先锋", "icon": "/assets/15bcb4d002b68470.webp", "primaryIcon": "/assets/b40570481582e92f.webp", "desc": "LibTV先锋作者", "verifyLevel": 1}], "score": 0, "createAt": "2026年04月28日 11:57", "updateAt": "2026年05月20日 22:12", "publishAt": "2026年04月28日 11:57", "playCount": 128, "viewCreationProcessCount": 55, "copyCanvasCount": 17, "shareCount": 2, "snapshotPath": "/data/canvas-snapshots/66bd4d27b7ee4064977569587ea04a73.json.gz", "snapshotSummary": {"nodes": 124, "edges": 158}}, "recommendList": []}